#: kbabel/prefwidgets.cpp:1405
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p><b>Source for difference lookup</b></p>"
"<p>Here you can select a source, which should be used for finding a "
"difference.</p>"
"<p>You can select file, translation database or corresponding "
"msgstr.</p>"
"<p>If you choose the translatio database, the messages to diff with are "
"taken from the Translation Database. To be useful you have to enable <i>"
"Auto add entry to database</i> in its preferences dialog.</p>"
"<p>The last option is useful for those using PO-files for "
"proofreading.</p>"
"<p>You can temporarily diff with messages from a file by choosing "
"<i>Tools->Diff->Open file for diff</i> in KBabel's main window.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""

#: kbabel/prefwidgets.cpp:1423
#, fuzzy
msgid "Base folder for diff files:"
msgstr "Basis gids vir diff lêers:"

#: kbabel/prefwidgets.cpp:1428
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<qt><q><b>Base folder for diff files</b></q>\n"
"<p>Here you can define a folder in which the files to diff with are stored. "
"If the files are stored at the same place beneath this folder as the "
"original files beneath their base folder, KBabel can automatically open the "
"correct file to diff with.</p>"
"<p>Note that this option has no effect if messages from the database are "
"used for diffing.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><q><b>Basis gids vir diff lêers</b></q>\n"
"<p>Hier jy kan definieer 'n gids, waar die lêers na diff met word gestoor "
"in. as die lêers word gestoor na die selfde plek onder hierdie gids as die "
"oorspronklike lêers onder hulle Basis gids, Kbabel kan automaties open die "
"korrek lêer na diff met.</p>"
"<p>"
"Nota wat hierdie opsie het nee effek as boodskappe van die databasis word "
"gebruik word vir diffing.</p></qt>"

#: kbabel/prefwidgets.cpp:1569
#, fuzzy
msgid "On the &fly spellchecking"
msgstr "Opsies vir spel toetsing"

#: kbabel/prefwidgets.cpp:1572
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p><b>On the fly spellchecking</b></p>"
"<p>Activate this to let KBabel spell check the text as you type. Mispelled "
"words will be colored by the error color.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""

#: kbabel/prefwidgets.cpp:1578
msgid "&Remember ignored words"
msgstr "Onthou geignoreer woorde"

#: kbabel/prefwidgets.cpp:1581
msgid "F&ile to store ignored words:"
msgstr "Lêer na stoor geignoreer woorde:"

#: kbabel/prefwidgets.cpp:1591
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p><b>Remember ignored words</b></p>"
"<p>Activate this, to let KBabel ignore the words, where you have chosen "
"<i>Ignore All</i> in the spell check dialog, in every spell check.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p><b>Onthou geignoreer woorde</b></p>"
"<p>Aktiveer hierdie, na laat Kbabel ignoreer die woorde, waar jy het gekies "
"<i>ignoreer Alle</i> in die spel bevestig dialoog, in elke spel "
"bevestig.</p></qt>"

